# Release signing config for the Amna Suraka Admin APK.
#
# 1. Generate a keystore ONCE (do this in your own terminal — it prompts for
#    passwords, which shouldn't go through anything that logs input):
#      keytool -genkeypair -v -keystore amnasuraka-release.keystore -alias amnasuraka -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000
#    Store the resulting .keystore file and both passwords somewhere durable
#    (a password manager) — losing them means you can never ship an update
#    that Android will accept as "the same app" again.
# 2. Copy this file to android/keystore.properties (gitignored — never commit
#    the real one) and fill in the real values below.
# 3. storeFile is relative to android/ (the Gradle root project directory).

storeFile=../amnasuraka-release.keystore
storePassword=change-me
keyAlias=amnasuraka
keyPassword=change-me
